ll,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_13","text":"ran electrical lines through the buildings that were still standing, and installed streetlights all over the place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_14","text":"After that, people started following her, even though she was an outsider.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_15","text":"An outsider? E.H.?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_16","text":"Hm? You didn't know?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_17","text":"... What do you think E.H. stands for? Do you know not her real name?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_18","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_18","text":"Everyone's... Hero...?","jump":"event_enterheaven_02_s_20","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_19","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_19","text":"I think I heard it was... Elysion Harper?","jump":"event_enterheaven_02_s_21","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_20","text":"Huh, so you don't even know that...","jump":"event_enterheaven_02_s_22","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_21","text":"So you know her name, but not that she was an outsider?","jump":"event_enterheaven_02_s_22","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_22","text":"Since it's Elysion that sent you, I figured they would've told you everything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_23","text":"Sounds like that's not the case.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_24","text":"Is there more I should know?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_25","text":"Hmm... It's probably better if you hear everything from E.H. directly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_26","text":"It's all really personal stuff, so I don't think it'd be right for me to talk about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_27","text":"She's our boss, you know, and I wanna respect that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_28","text":"For now, just know that E.H. was originally an outsider who came into the Outer Rim on her own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_29","text":"All right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_30","text":"You two seem to be on pretty good terms with her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_31","text":"Who, with E.H.?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_32","text":"I mean, it's not like we were strangers before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_33","text":"We already knew she treated her people well, even back when she led Heavenly Ascension.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_34","text":"Once she actually became our boss, though, that's when we really understood why people liked her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_35","text":"Yeah, yeah! Boss treats me well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_36","text":"She does say I can't bite whatever I want, though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_enterheaven_02_s_37","text":"There's a lot of things she tells me not to do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_enterheaven_02_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_SubScenario:even